{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snag as much Halloween candy as you can and keep <strong>Vlod</strong>, <strong>Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod</strong> happy.<br>How? Easy peasy: blast through waves of incoming baddies like skeletons, skull-heads, ghosts and pop those explosive pumpkins.<br>That\u2019s where your three chaotic buddies come in <strong>Vlod, Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod.</strong><br>The map shifts every minute, enemies get nastier as you level up, and the sugar rush never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/f106e454c8072e2065eb19fa2eefa225.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/f106e454c8072e2065eb19fa2eefa225.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vlod:</strong> Rapid-fire, low damage, basically your ride-or-die buddy who never lets you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fronk:</strong> Deals chunky area damage where its shots land. Hits like a truck but suuuper slow to fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: jump and shoot straight down with Fronk to rocket-boost yourself into the sky.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blod:</strong> Short range, slow as heck, but packs a desperate-times-call-for-massive-damage punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.mp4?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your candy haul to buy permanent upgrades and snag even MORE candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your in-match upgrades wisely too\u2026 or you\u2019ll end up face-planting six feet under way too soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades fix your weapons\u2019 weak spots. Boost <strong>Vlod\u2019s</strong> damage or speed up <strong>Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod\u2019s</strong> fire rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.mp4?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and hey\u2026 when you\u2019re blasting pumpkins, try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/476b9c02fcae4ed7e90101d7052b8910.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/476b9c02fcae4ed7e90101d7052b8910.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057530?t=1761853591","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/06c0b5dcd364b3fbd028b29c2503aabf44709ea8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761853591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/63553209cc3f90b6e7068d4c461149f1533b7d75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761853591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/63553209cc3f90b6e7068d4c461149f1533b7d75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761853591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snag as much Halloween candy as you can and keep <strong>Vlod</strong>, <strong>Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod</strong> happy.<br>How? Easy peasy: blast through waves of incoming baddies like skeletons, skull-heads, ghosts and pop those explosive pumpkins.<br>That\u2019s where your three chaotic buddies come in <strong>Vlod, Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod.</strong><br>The map shifts every minute, enemies get nastier as you level up, and the sugar rush never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/f106e454c8072e2065eb19fa2eefa225.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/f106e454c8072e2065eb19fa2eefa225.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vlod:</strong> Rapid-fire, low damage, basically your ride-or-die buddy who never lets you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fronk:</strong> Deals chunky area damage where its shots land. Hits like a truck but suuuper slow to fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: jump and shoot straight down with Fronk to rocket-boost yourself into the sky.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blod:</strong> Short range, slow as heck, but packs a desperate-times-call-for-massive-damage punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/3dc6d4e5d5b73eda4d21eee28697d37b.mp4?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your candy haul to buy permanent upgrades and snag even MORE candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your in-match upgrades wisely too\u2026 or you\u2019ll end up face-planting six feet under way too soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades fix your weapons\u2019 weak spots. Boost <strong>Vlod\u2019s</strong> damage or speed up <strong>Fronk</strong> and <strong>Blod\u2019s</strong> fire rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/7e00c4bee5d1a20d1b679c4ef42c14b8.mp4?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and hey\u2026 when you\u2019re blasting pumpkins, try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/476b9c02fcae4ed7e90101d7052b8910.poster.avif?t=1761853591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/extras/476b9c02fcae4ed7e90101d7052b8910.webm?t=1761853591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["kikek's bag"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057530/b963d54a3962025726d62ab8e630bec2d01373a9/header.jpg?t=1761853591","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057530/1018320656/29dba7b5a59b7549be166b5d40b97c82669c2543/1758708726/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759329385","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057530/1018320656/29dba7b5a59b7549be166b5d40b97c82669c2543/1758708726/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759329385","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai